{"meta":{"id":"directive","category":"it/syntax/jsp/setup","title":"지시어 · taglib · JSP","subtitle":"(JSP · JSTL · EL)","summary":"page import, include 지시어 vs jsp:include, JSTL core · fn · fmt taglib","tags":["jsp","f-import"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>JSP · JSTL · EL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">지시어 · taglib · JSP</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> page import, include 지시어 vs jsp:include, JSTL core · fn · fmt taglib</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">지시어 · 액션 태그</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;%@ page language=&quot;java&quot; contentType=&quot;text/html; charset=UTF-8&quot; pageEncoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot; %&gt;\r\n&lt;%@ page import=&quot;com.spring.sExam.vo.MemberVO&quot; %&gt;            &lt;!-- java 클래스 import --&gt;\r\n&lt;%@ include file=&quot;/WEB-INF/include/header.jsp&quot; %&gt;           &lt;!-- 파일 내용을 그대로 합쳐서 컴파일 --&gt;\r\n&lt;jsp:include page=&quot;/WEB-INF/include/bs4.jsp&quot; /&gt;              &lt;!-- 실행 결과를 가져와 출력 --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;%@ taglib uri=&quot;http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core&quot; prefix=&quot;c&quot; %&gt;         &lt;!-- 변수 · if · for --&gt;\r\n&lt;%@ taglib uri=&quot;http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/functions&quot; prefix=&quot;fn&quot; %&gt;   &lt;!-- 함수 --&gt;\r\n&lt;%@ taglib uri=&quot;http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/fmt&quot; prefix=&quot;fmt&quot; %&gt;        &lt;!-- 숫자 · 날짜 포맷 --&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">include 지시어 vs jsp:include</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">&lt;%@ include file %&gt;</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">&lt;jsp:include page /&gt;</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">시점</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">컴파일 전 — 소스를 합침</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실행 시 — 결과를 포함</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">변수 공유</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가능 (한 파일이 됨)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">불가 (별도 페이지)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">공통 변수 · taglib 선언</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">header · footer · 부트스트랩 링크 묶음</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-teal-700 font-semibold\">원본 메모의 jstl taglib 줄은 &lt;%@ … %&gt; 의 &lt; 와 &gt; 가 빠져 있어 보완했다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JavaScript › script · css 연결, Java › package · import</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/setup/directive","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"setup","title":"기본 연결","path":"it/syntax/jsp/setup"}],"hasImage":false}